  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "异界主持人强迫你玩木制棋盘，而棋局目标是征服大陆、夺取飞艇并驶向深渊",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "The creature behind the desk insists that you play their wooden board game. And in this game, you are a captain looking for the mysterious realm known only as the abyss. To reach such a place, you’ll need to conquer a continent, acquire an airship, and sail into cursed skies.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3141310/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "木制棋子就是受你指挥的船员，可持续精炼升级后部署到回合制棋盘",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Refine and upgrade a collection of distinct pieces and deploy them in a turn-based strategy board game. These pieces are your crew, and they will do as you say.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3141310/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "每局中途可把倒下的敌人招募成新棋子，直接扩充自己的收藏",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Add new pieces to your collection in the middle of each run by recruiting fallen foes. Whether or not they joined voluntarily is irrelevant, since they will bleed for you all the same.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3141310/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
